🚀 How to Run Pacific War 1
You don't need to install anything to start your command. Follow these simple steps to get the game running in seconds.

Option 1: The "Drop & Play" Method (Recommended)
This is the fastest way to play using online-python.com.

Download the PacificWar1.py file from this repository to your computer.

Open online-python.com in your web browser.

Drag and Drop the PacificWar1.py file directly onto the webpage's code editor area.

The website will automatically load the code. Click the "Run" button at the bottom of the screen.

The game will initialize in the terminal window below.

Option 2: Local Execution
If you have Python installed on your machine:

Open your terminal or command prompt.

Navigate to the file's location.

Run: python PacificWar1.py

