⚓ Basic Controls Cheat Sheet
When the game is running, you will interact with the terminal using these keys:

M (Move): Relocate your ship. Remember: Destroyers are the fastest (3 tiles)!

F (Fire): Launch a shell at specific X, Y coordinates.

A (Ability): Trigger class-specific skills like Sonar Ping or Air Recon.

R (Repair): Available if you haven't moved for 3 turns. Heals up to 75% HP.

